<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Command (spell)</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 4), Necromancer (guild level 28)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast command &lt;target&gt; &lt;word&gt;
</pre>
<p>Commands the target to do one thing, a single word: the target obeys and 
does it at once. For example:
</p>
<pre>cast command guard sleep
cast command bandit flee
</pre>
<p><b>Sleep</b> is special: the target lies down and falls asleep, if they were 
standing, sitting or resting.
</p><p>The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail. If it does, they 
know what you tried, and attack you. Some words can't be commanded: quit, 
clear, cdefect, password, typo, bug and idea.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p>For the list of commands you can type yourself, see <a cmd='#'>Help Commands</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sleep</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Healers</a>
</pre>




</div>